> **Note:** In the menu: **Postacie › Otoczenie** (the in-game menu is in Polish for now).

A list of every character within the radius (default 30 m), including your party and the dead. Filter by type (humans, monsters, party, dead…) and use the same actions as on the [Target](doc:target) page on any of them: target, teleport, pull, add to party, calm, make hostile, freeze, kill, revive, remove, make a portrait.

```trainer
{"path": "Characters › Surroundings", "title": "Around you — 30 m", "rows": [
 {"t": "tabs", "items": ["All", "Humans", "Monsters", "Party", "Dead"], "active": 0},
 {"t": "text", "label": "Scavenger", "value": "12 m · hostile"},
 {"t": "text", "label": "Guard (Gate)", "value": "18 m · neutral"},
 {"t": "text", "label": "Molerat", "value": "24 m · hostile"}
]}
```

> **Note:** In the menu: **Wizualia › Kolory** (the in-game menu is in Polish for now).

Every kind of character and item has its own colour — enemies, neutrals, party, spawned, arena, items by category, chests. Click a colour to change it; the preview at the top shows the result.

```trainer
{"path": "Visuals › Colours", "title": "Characters", "rows": [
 {"t": "text", "label": "Enemies", "value": "■ red"},
 {"t": "text", "label": "Neutral", "value": "■ grey"},
 {"t": "text", "label": "Party", "value": "■ green"},
 {"t": "text", "label": "Spawned", "value": "■ purple"}
]}
```
